      ">News &amp; Media</h5></div></div><hr class="Header_w100__LXdNC"/><div class="Header_dropdownMenuFont__B1UBq Header_mobileLinksContainer__kCaa7 Header_mobileFont__I8HUK"><a data-testid="custom-link" target="" href="/about-us"><div data-testid="rich-text" class="RichTextBloks_richTextBlocks__aa0VW"><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF">About NRF</span></p></div></a><a data-testid="custom-link" target="" href="/membership"><div data-testid="rich-text" class="RichTextBloks_richTextBlocks__aa0VW"><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF">Membership</span></p></div></a><a class="AuthProfile_login__dNFOe" href="https://account.nrf.com/?callbackUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fnrf.com%2Fresearch%2F2024-consumer-returns-retail-industry%3F">Login</a></div><hr class="Header_w100__LXdNC"/><div class="Header_dropdownMenuFont__B1UBq Header_mobileLinksContainer__kCaa7 Header_mobileFont__I8HUK"><a style="display:flex;align-items:center" href="/search">Search<img class="undefined" src="/assets/icon-search.svg" alt="Search" width="14" height="14" style="margin-left:4px"/></a></div></div></div></header><div class="Header_blurOverlay__d2s5n Header_dNone__229ly"></div><ul data-testid="breadcrumbs" class="Breadcrumbs_breadcrumbs__25Iuz"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li></ul><main><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage__AotXE"><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_type_wrappepr__iEbqX"><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_type__GVHqq">Consumer Trends</div></div><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_inner___IE_S"><section class="ArticlePage_articlePage_top__S3dyl"><h1 style="text-align:left">NRF and Happy Returns 2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry</h1><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_header__iXKTG"><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_header_bio__K_FAx"><div class="ArticlePage_authorsContainer__a60Ml"><div><strong>National Retail Federation</strong><div></div></div></div><div>December 5, 2024</div></div><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_header_social__z3dgq"><div></div></div></div></section><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_content__YoRae"><div style="display:block;gap:30px" class="Quote_quoteContainer__abgsm Quote_reverse__JtwJV" data-testid="quote-test"><div class="Quote_quoteExcerpt__Poa0z " style="float:right;margin-left:29px;margin-bottom:10px;color:#f40000;border-color:#f40000;background-color:#3c3a40;background-image:url(&quot;https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1021220/885x299/afcc34f02b/bg-wavy-alt.svg&quot;);background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center;text-align:start"><div data-testid="rich-text" class="RichTextBloks_richTextBlocks__aa0VW"><h3><span class="h6"><span style="color:#FFFFFF">2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry</span></span></h3><div class="CallToAction_callToActionContainer__nDW7e" style="justify-content:center"><style>
        .custom_button_i-1fd26d79-ae10-4621-91a4-00aa21733f0f {
          background-color: #ffffff;
          border: #ffffff; border-style: solid; border-width: 2px;
          
          box-shadow: ;
          color: #000000;
          
        }
        
        .custom_button_i-1fd26d79-ae10-4621-91a4-00aa21733f0f:hover {
          background-color: #f40000;
          border: #f40000; border-style: solid; border-width: 2px;
          box-shadow: ;
          color: #ffffff;
        }
      </style><a data-testid="call-to-action" class="custom_button custom_button_i-1fd26d79-ae10-4621-91a4-00aa21733f0f" style="margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;width:100%" href="https://nrf.com/api/asset/storyblok?request=vHoxpw%2F8Xp5SVLhzLYGw4NrFm4%2FzhUlvygwuFbnjguRa2YQi%2BqJqgZ6T31ZQFKZQRj7G5L5B0z%2Bh2VwCTEwSb3EL07I7cQ4NW6NUB9d4IuSPQHqaMIIIU1w%2BPklbx2sSFwEaGAKJypF%2B1HYVMl3zSsIs3haaIqed7Ifc1807bbcE6ffXLy0uyzfDJd4%2B%7C3f2q7rhCv7Es0SwR">DOWNLOAD REPORT</a></div></div></div><div class="Quote_text__w1pBm  " style="text-align:start" id="Quote_displayBlockChildren__jDBtW"><div data-testid="rich-text" class="RichTextBloks_richTextBlocks__aa0VW"><p>To understand the shifting landscape that is retail returns, NRF and Happy Returns, a UPS company, explored both consumer and retailer perspectives and priorities for the returns experience in 2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry. The report explores the impact of returns for the retail industry, consumer expectations for returns, retailers’ priorities and strategies for returns, the challenge of fraudulent and abusive returns practices and the vision for returns in 2025. Key findings include: </p><ul><li><p>Total returns for the retail industry are projected to reach $890 billion in 2024.</p></li><li><p>76% of consumers consider free returns a key factor in deciding where to shop.</p></li><li><p>More than two-thirds of retailers surveyed say they are prioritizing upgrading their returns capabilities within the next six months.</p></li><li><p>A majority (93%) of retailers said retail fraud and other exploitive behavior is a significant issue for their business.</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div><section class="ArticlePage_articlePage_bottom__pl9Hh"><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_footer__ejvzt"><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_footer_tags__6ixZo"><ul><li><a href="/search?crawler_prod_NRFCOM%5BrefinementList%5D%5BcontentCategory%5D%5B0%5D=Industry%20Research">Industry Research</a></li><li><a href="/search?crawler_prod_NRFCOM%5BrefinementList%5D%5BcontentCategory%5D%5B0%5D=Return%20Fraud">Return Fraud</a></li><li><a href="/search?crawler_prod_NRFCOM%5BrefinementList%5D%5BcontentCategory%5D%5B0%5D=Reverse%20Logistics">Reverse Logistics</a></li></ul></div><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_footer_social__i6Xa8"><div></div></div></div><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_related_content__C93yf"><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_related_content_header__lH97w">Related Content</div><div class="ArticlePage_articlePage_related_content_list__TCF7C"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card__pg0SS"><a href="/blog/how-retail-contributes-to-the-us-economy" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_img_link__XdyoU"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_img__V7aCi" style="background-image:url(https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1021220/1440x960/fdca739f2d/warehouse_worker.jpg)"></div></a><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_body__RV0A9"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_tags_container__F_4_n"><a class="Tag_tag__dXSaw" style="color:#000000" href="/search?crawler_prod_NRFCOM%5BrefinementList%5D%5BcontentCategory%5D%5B0%5D=Economy">Economy</a><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_publish_date__SpQo8">Nov 3, 2026</div></div><a href="/blog/how-retail-contributes-to-the-us-economy" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_header_link__u_NIa"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_header__nbUn3">How retail contributes to the U.S. economy</div></a><a href="/blog/how-retail-contributes-to-the-us-economy" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_description_link__U3mQt"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_description__cWZal">NRF’s research explains retail’s role in jobs, income, businesses and economic output </div></a></div></div><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card__pg0SS"><a href="/media-center/press-releases/retailers-see-fraud-schemes-evolve-as-shoplifting-declines-nrf-study-finds" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_img_link__XdyoU"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_img__V7aCi" style="background-image:url(/assets/default-images-blue.png)"></div></a><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_body__RV0A9"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_tags_container__F_4_n"><a class="Tag_tag__dXSaw" style="color:#000000" href="/search?crawler_prod_NRFCOM%5BrefinementList%5D%5BcontentCategory%5D%5B0%5D=Industry%20Research">Industry Research</a></div><a href="/media-center/press-releases/retailers-see-fraud-schemes-evolve-as-shoplifting-declines-nrf-study-finds" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_header_link__u_NIa"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_header__nbUn3">Retailers See Fraud Schemes Evolve as Shoplifting Declines, NRF Study Finds</div></a><a href="/media-center/press-releases/retailers-see-fraud-schemes-evolve-as-shoplifting-declines-nrf-study-finds" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_description_link__U3mQt"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_description__cWZal">According to the Impact of Theft &amp; Violence 2026 report, retailers saw a 12.4% drop in shoplifting incidents and an 8.1% decrease in retail merchandise theft in 2025 compared with 2024, while other forms of external theft, fraud and scams continued to rise.</div></a></div></div><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card__pg0SS"><a href="/blog/4-fundamental-insights-from-nrf-protect-2026" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_img_link__XdyoU"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_img__V7aCi" style="background-image:url(https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1021220/1440x972/003ef03ca6/nrf_protect26_vs.jpg)"></div></a><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_body__RV0A9"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_tags_container__F_4_n"><a class="Tag_tag__dXSaw" style="color:#000000" href="/search?crawler_prod_NRFCOM%5BrefinementList%5D%5BcontentCategory%5D%5B0%5D=Artificial%20Intelligence">Artificial Intelligence</a></div><a href="/blog/4-fundamental-insights-from-nrf-protect-2026" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_header_link__u_NIa"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_header__nbUn3">4 fundamental insights from NRF PROTECT 2026</div></a><a href="/blog/4-fundamental-insights-from-nrf-protect-2026" class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_description_link__U3mQt"><div class="ResoucerCardComponent_resource_card_description__cWZal">How LP leaders are confronting evolving risks in retail </div></a></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></main><footer class="Footer_footer__M1kZR" data-testid="nrf-footer" style="color:#000000;font-size:14px;background-color:#ededed;margin-top:100px"><style>
